== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|Beans!}}.
* Pyro is a reference to [[wikipedia:pyromania|pyromania]], a disorder characterized by an obsession with setting things on fire. In this case it's bomb fuses.
* This item is the bomb counterpart to {{i|A Dollar}} and {{i|Skeleton Key}}.
* This item uses a similar costume to {{i|Boom!}}.

